   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automated-butchery.lua",
   "source": "You override all security measures of your tinkers, allowing you to reset the cooldown of %d of most of your steamtech talents of tier %d or less and instantly increases your steam level by %d%% of the maximum.\n\t\tIn addition for 6 turns your maximum steam capacity is doubled, but steam regeneration is halved.\n\t\t#{italic}#Master of Tech, Master of Death!#{normal}#",
   "source_sha256": "bd06395673b50a889fb54f19edee4cefaa3cad5d685b179a75922d1ef6b12d08",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "target": "你解除全部插件的安全限制，从你大部分蒸汽科技技能中重置最多 %d 个层级不高于 %d 的技能冷却时间，并立即获得相当于最大蒸汽值 %d%% 的蒸汽。\n\t\t此外，在 6 回合内，蒸汽值上限翻倍，但蒸汽恢复速度减半。\n\t\t#{italic}#科技至尊、死亡之主！#{normal}#",
