   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/bullets-mastery.lua",
   "source": "By sending a stream of hot steam over your bullets you overheat them. For the next %d turns, each bullet will set the target ablaze, making it burn for %0.2f fire damage over 5 turns (most of your shooting talents fire two bullets at once).\n\t\tDamage will increase with Steampower.\n\t\tOnly one bullet enhancement can be used at once.",
   "source_sha256": "046e8beb3f6248ff42f83e8f48dbc303fa73df960e7d9af7648db0a1c32b8e65",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "target": "使用蒸汽对子弹进行过热处理。接下来的 %d 回合内，你的子弹会点燃目标，在 5 回合内造成 %0.2f 火焰伤害（大多数射击技能一次发射两枚弹药）。\n\t\t伤害随蒸汽强度提高。\n\t\t一次只能使用一种弹药强化能力。",
